@startuml Digi Bank - Service Discovery
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
title Digi Bank\nService Registration and Lookup

component "Discovery Server\n:8761" as discovery

node "Registered services" as services {
  component "Customer Service" as customer
  component "Account Service" as account
  component "Transaction Service" as transaction
  component "Compliance Service" as compliance
  component "Notification Service" as notification
}

component "API Gateway" as gateway

customer --> discovery : register
account --> discovery : register
transaction --> discovery : register
compliance --> discovery : register
notification --> discovery : register
gateway --> discovery : lookup service
discovery --> gateway : service address

note bottom
  The workshop uses a lightweight registry boundary rather than Eureka.
  Docker Compose provides the local service host.
end note
@enduml
